# Language Policy

IMPORTANT: Follow the configured language settings for all work in this project.

## Enforcement

This is a prompt instruction, not a mechanical gate. Nothing in the harness inspects the language of a comment, a commit message, or a response: the pre-commit Lore check validates the commit type prefix and sign-off trailers only, and no linter or CI step reads language at all. A violation surfaces as a review finding, so an agent cannot rely on a gate to catch it.

- **Code comments**: Write all code comments, docstrings, and inline documentation in {{.Language.Comments}}
- **Commit messages**: Write all git commit messages in {{.Language.Commits}}
- **AI responses**: Respond to the user in {{.Language.AIResponses}}
